102: | PFAR = device-relative `paddr` | `uld pfar` (0x10 vs `0xfff46010`), `vme pfar` (0x90 vs `0xfff40090`), `luna pfar` (0 vs `0x3ffffff0`). This is the (d) swap. The at-base LUNA access still reds. |
103: | PFSR only | The three `pfar` rows and `luna pfar`. |
104: | Both CMMUs, or sibling cleared to SUCCESS | The four `icmmu` rows. SUCCESS << 16 is 0, which is not either instruction seed. |
105: | Conditioned on `writeflag == MEM_READ` | `ust pfsr`, `ust pfar`. |
106: | Keyed to one device, base, or length | The other device's `pfsr`/`pfar`. |
107: | Exception dropped | `uld`/`ust`/`vme`/`luna` `route`. |
